        "temperament": "Skittish",
        "wild": "This large, wing-membraned lizard is generally skittish and will flee when threatened. It is an accomplished glider, using its extensive wing membranes to travel great distances from elevated positions. It forages for both plant and animal matter and is generally inoffensive unless cornered.",
